26,10,10)\">Ezek 10:10</ref> (apparently masculine) compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> &amp; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sm')\">Sm</lookup> who translate <highlight>the likeness of one had they all four</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> reads <bdbheb>אחת</bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 5:1", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Isa 40:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 40, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Gen 5:3", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Gen 1:26", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 1, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Ezek 1:5", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 1, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ezek 1:26", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 1, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Ezek 8:2", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 8, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 10:1", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 10, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Dan 10:16", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 10, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ezek 1:10", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 1, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 1:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 1, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ezek 1:22", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 1, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ezek 10:10", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 10, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 10:21", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 10, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Ezek 10:22", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 10, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ezek 1:28", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 1, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "2Kgs 16:10", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 16, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "2Chr 4:3", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 4, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 13:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 13, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezek 23:15", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 23, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ps 58:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 58, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ezek 1:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 1, "verse": 13}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["דְּמוּת", "דִּמְוַת", "דִּמְוָה", "׳", "ד", "דְּמוּתוֺ", "דְּמוּתֵנוּ", "דְּמוּת כְּמַרְאֵה (אֵשׁׅ", "כִּסֵּא", "כְּמַרְאֵה ד", "כִּדְמוּת בְּנֵי אָדָם", "דְּמוּת כְּמַרְאֵה אָדָם", "מַרְאֵה ד", "כְּבוֺד י", "צֶלֶם", "אֵל", "דִּמָ